el pi-secondary-font\">Light</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"colorbox\" style=\"background-color: #00ffff; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: inline-block;\"></span>  <span style=\"35|margin: 0 0 0 0.4em;}}\">2 sqm</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7.8<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">August 1, 2006<br/>Summer Update 2006</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: <a href=\"#/wiki/Creatures\">Creatures</a></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-item-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20060803212828&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Quara_Constrictor_0de67a.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"creature-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a quara constrictor scout.</div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"><li>Tssss!</li><li>Gaaahhh!</li><li>Gluh! Gluh!</li><li>Boohaa!</li></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<div class=\"webdesc\"><blockquote class=\"webdesc-text\"><p>The Quara Constrictor Scout is a weaker version of <a href=\"#/wiki/Quara%20Constrictor\">Quara Constrictors</a>.</p></blockquote>\n<div class=\"webdesc-from\" style=\"float: right; margin: 0 2em 0 0;\">—Tibia Library</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<p>A weaker version of <a href=\"#/wiki/Quara%20Constrictor\">Quara Constrictors</a>. This monster can be seen during raids on <a href=\"#/wiki/Liberty%20Bay\">Liberty Bay</a>.\nYou may hunt 400 Quara Constrictor Scouts, <a href=\"#/wiki/Quara%20Hydromancer%20Scout\">Quara Hydromancer Scouts</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Quara%20Mantassin%20Scout\">Quara Mantassin Scouts</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Quara%20Pincher%20Scout\">Quara Pincher Scouts</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Quara%20Predator%20Scout\">Quara Predator Scouts</a> combined as a task of the <a href=\"#/quest/killing-in-the-name-of-quest\">Killing in the Name of... Quest</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-abilities\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Abilities\">Abilities</span></h3>\n<div class=\"ability_list\"><div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span> Melee</span> (0-130+)</div>⁠, <div class=\"creatureAbility abilityWithScene\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Life%20Drain\"><img alt=\"Life Drain\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Life_Drain_Icon_bda9d3.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Berserk\">Life Drain Berserk</a></span> (0-80+)<div class=\"abilityScene\"><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"scene_table canvas\" style=\"padding:32px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n<div class=\"tile\">\n<div class=\"effect\"></div>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td>\n<div class=\"tile\">\n<div class=\"effect\"></div>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td>\n<div class=\"tile\">\n<div class=\"effect\"></div>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<div class=\"tile\">\n<div class=\"effect\"></div>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td>\n<div class=\"tile\">\n<div cl